# ACD

- Use `npx acd <stage>` as the control plane (intake, specify, implement, review, pr, fix, approve, reject, status, config).
- Do not mark specs approved; HitL is configuration. Never invert artifact authority.
- While the pipeline is red, only `acd fix`.
- Canonical skills: `.acd/skills/`. Agent rules: `.acd/agents/`.
